In a game yesterday I picked up 7 candles. I lit them to explore some of
the mines, expecting that they would burn one at a time, and after one
went out I would be left with six. But not so, the candle went out and I
found all seven had burnt. And they burnt only as long as one candle,
and lit the same area.
Despite this, I think the new lighting code is great. By the way, are...

Spoilers?

...all oil lamps magic? I've only found two so far, and both have yielded
djinnis. When I died the inventory didn't call them magic lamps. Maybe
magic is a poor term to use now, and simply every lamp has a djinni.
And they seem not to be rechargable (djinniwise).

Regarding this spoiler issue, I can't quite see why you would read this
news group if you aren't going to read spoilers. Practically everything
in the group is either a spoiler, a question asking for answers which are
spoilers, or the generally boring nethack administation and installation
problems, which are only interesting to those who wrote them. Tell me
what is left. Oh, I forgot, the obligatory first ascension posts, which
invariably contain..... SPOILERS!!!

